fter my two commits — so writing the evidence didn't stale the evidence. But `round_entries` at that identity is **empty** and `phases_owed` returns `['REVIEW-A']`: the rework changed the non-record tree, so the round-025 verdict stopped governing the moment it was answered. Seven logged rounds sit on this branch and none speaks for this tree. **The lane owes a fresh REVIEW-A before it can merge** — that's the gate refusing to let its own author close over it, not a defect.\n\nBoth commits carry the `WI: WI-579` trailer; spec is in `docs/archive/work/complete/` with `specref` cleared and Deliverable before Context; the stale empty `active/` dir and the scratch worktree are cleaned up. Working tree clean, nothing pushed.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"d6a44a33-b6fa-4301-8a9d-8a491e68bd04","total_cost_usd":3.0841255,"usage":{"input_tokens":81,"cache_creation_input_tokens":94196,"cache_read_input_tokens":3247645,"output_tokens":20543,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":94196,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":995,"cache_read_input_tokens":111327,"cache_creation_input_tokens":415,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":415},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":4253,"outputTokens":22,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.004363,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-5":{"inputTokens":81,"outputTokens":20543,"cacheReadInputTokens":3247645,"cacheCreationInputTokens":94196,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":3.0797624999999997,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"569923c0-19fa-4900-887f-b9b291d72915"}
